**Summary:**  
These patches ensure that all segment writers accept and propagate a `depth` parameter, so that segments inside `GeometryCollection` geometries are properly tracked and updated during modify interactions. This will fix the bug where dragging a shared vertex in a `GeometryCollection` only updates one geometry instead of all relevant ones.
